/// A size or distance, possibly expressed with contextual units.
///
/// Typst supports the following length units:
///
/// - Points: `{72pt}`
/// - Millimeters: `{254mm}`
/// - Centimeters: `{2.54cm}`
/// - Inches: `{1in}`
/// - Relative to font size: `{2.5em}`
///
/// You can multiply lengths with and divide them by integers and floats.
///
/// = Example <example>
/// ```example
/// #rect(width: 20pt)
/// #rect(width: 2em)
/// #rect(width: 1in)
///
/// #(3em + 5pt).em \
/// #(20pt).em \
/// #(40em + 2pt).abs \
/// #(5em).abs
/// ```
///
/// = Fields <fields>
